{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>From wine and strong drink he shall abstain.</b> He shall not afflict himself with fasting that diminishes service of Heaven, according to the words of the Sages, and he shall not mortify his body with ascetic blows after the manner of hypocrites and monks, but he shall separate himself from wine — for through this he greatly diminishes prayer and subdues his inclination, and he does not weaken his strength at all thereby."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:48.387197831Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}